 "remarks": "Opportunity awaits in desirable Shippan Point! Tucked away on a quiet, tree-lined cul-de-sac, this well-maintained 3-bedroom, 1.5-bath Colonial is ready for its next chapter and offers the chance to create your own vision in one of Stamford's most sought-after coastal neighborhoods. Ready for updating, the home provides a blank slate with the potential to renovate or reimagine the existing space to suit your lifestyle. Enjoy a walkable location near the beach, with easy access to Metro-North, I-95, Harbor Point, downtown Stamford, parks, dining, and shopping. Bring your ideas and transform this home into something truly special. This is an estate and Sold-As-Is",
